    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L09-ACTIVITY-008",
      "SourceSection": "9.3: Which is Greater?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "For \\(x>0\\), which function do you think has greater values? Be prepared to share your reasoning with the class.",
